{"id":"09faa5990bf8","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring","lang":"en","title":"Appealing to the monitoring on the Corporation","description":"In addition to the right to launch Student Initiatives and Student Referendums, every Bachelor's and Master's student regularly enrolled at USI has the right, as a member of the Corporation, to appeal to the monitoring exercised by the University on the Corporation, if he or she…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Organisation","Student Corporation","Participate"],"image":null,"words":143,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/organizzazione/corporazione-studentesca/partecipare/sorveglianza","en":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Organisation","path":"/en/originalnode/8519"},{"label":"Student Corporation","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"Participate","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate"},{"label":"Appealing to the monitoring on the Corporation","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>In addition to the right to launch <a href=\"/en/originalnode/16839\">Student Initiatives</a> and <a href=\"/en/originalnode/16835\">Student Referendums</a>, every Bachelor's and Master's student regularly enrolled at USI has the right, as a member of the Corporation, to appeal to the monitoring exercised by the University on the Corporation, if he or she believes that the conduct of the Corporation and in particular of the <a href=\"/en/originalnode/16831\">Student Council</a> (or one of its members) is causing harm or prejudice to individual students, the student body as a whole, the University or third parties.</p> <p><strong>How to</strong></p> <p>Contact the Pro-Rector for Education and Students’ Experience.</p> <p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p> <p>The Pro-Rector for Education and Students’ Experience opens an investigation to assess the situation and if necessary proposes to the <a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/rectorate\">Rectorate of the University</a> to take action against the Corporation. If requested, the anonymity of those who have appealed to the monitoring board is guaranteed.</p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Student Corporation","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"How it works","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/how-it-works"},{"label":"Structure","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/structure"},{"label":"Direct democracy","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/direct-democracy"},{"label":"Budget","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget"},{"label":"Run for / elect","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/candidates-elections"},{"label":"Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/initiatives"},{"label":"Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/referendums"},{"label":"Vote","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/voting"},{"label":"Submit an idea","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/submitting-ideas"},{"label":"Monitoring","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring"},{"label":"List of Decisions","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-decisions"},{"label":"List of Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-initiatives"},{"label":"List of Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-referendums"},{"label":"Calendar","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-calendar"},{"label":"Student Corporation news","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-news"},{"label":"Newsletter","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/newsletter"},{"label":"For student associations","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/for-associations"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/faq"}],"links":[{"label":"corporazione-studentesca@usi.ch","href":"mailto:corporazione-studentesca@usi.ch"},{"label":"About the Student Corporation","href":"/originalnode/16808"},{"label":"How the Student Corporation works","href":"/originalnode/16809"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T19:09:14.907Z"}